# Managed by Coriolis appliance bootstrap — SSH MAC hardening.
# Removes the weak Message Authentication Code algorithms (hmac-sha1, umac-64 and
# their -etm variants) flagged by the vulnerability scanner, leaving only strong
# encrypt-then-MAC algorithms. Edit the bootstrap role to change.
MACs hmac-sha2-512-etm@openssh.com,hmac-sha2-256-etm@openssh.com,umac-128-etm@openssh.com
